    {
      "text": "X should go out and ban every network ring that pays others to quote/comment on their posts.\n\nIf you want to see how it’s done:\n\n> companies pay influencers to comment/quote their posts (now sometimes with labels)\n\n> they spawn new accounts like ___ “finance” or ___ “<insert country here>”with a new affiliated account\n\n> when each company gets big enough they just interact with one another eg. quote posts to boost engagement.\n\nBy the end each affiliate account ends up with tens/hundreds of thousands of followers.\n\nAnd they use it to boost their other account visibility.\n\nMy worry is that X is ",
